{{High Risk|Template:Ref|nocat=1|pagetype=Main}}
Outputs the '''References''' section: a level-2 <code>== References ==</code> heading followed by a scrollable list (max height 300&nbsp;px) containing every <code><nowiki><ref>…</ref></nowiki></code> footnote on the page. It is a shorthand for a styled <code><nowiki><references /></nowiki></code>. Takes no parameters.

==Syntax==
{{T|Ref}}

==Usage==
Place it '''once''', near the bottom of an article, after all <code><nowiki><ref></nowiki></code> tags. Do not add a separate <code>== References ==</code> heading — this template supplies its own.
<pre>
Some claim.<ref>Source here.</ref>

{{Ref}}
</pre>